@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Cadastro válido
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "Ana@Example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Mesmo e-mail de novo (esperado: 409)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Dados inválidos (esperado: 400)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "email": "nao-e-email", "password": "123" }

### Tentativa de virar admin (esperado: 201 com role MEMBER)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mallory", "email": "mallory@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123", "role": "ADMIN" }

### Login válido (esperado: 200 com accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Senha errada (esperado: 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "senha-errada-123" }

### E-mail inexistente (esperado: 401, mesma mensagem acima)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ninguem@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Rota protegida com token (esperado: 200 com seus dados)
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Rota protegida sem token (esperado: 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### Rota protegida com token falso (esperado: 401 INVALID_TOKEN)
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer isto.nao.eh-um-token